"no answer" means the child was still searching after 3 seconds and was killed.

patterns with no backreference, python re:
  ^(a+)+$                  16 a's then '!'        no match
  ^(a+)+$                  120 a's                match
  ^(a+)+$                  120 a's then '!'       no answer
  ^(a|a)*$                 120 a's then '!'       no answer
  ^(\s*|\t)+$              120 spaces then '!'    no answer
  ^(\w+\s?)*$              120 a's then '!'       no answer
  ^([a-z]{2,4})+$          120 a's then '!'       no answer
  the email regex          a@a. 20 a's then '!'   no match
  the email regex          a@a. 120 a's then '!'  no answer

the same engine, with the pattern changed instead:
  ^(?>a+)+$                120 a's then '!'       no match
  ^(a++)+$                 120 a's then '!'       no match
  ^a+$                     120 a's then '!'       no match
  the email regex, fixed   a@a. 120 a's then '!'  no match
